      "side": 1,
      "message": "For the sake of clarity and namespacing (w.r.t. the rest of the DT), could this node also be under `/avf`[*]? By definition, I don\u0027t think we should worry about \"secure\" (non-non-secure) properties overwriting these because they are trusted.\n\n[*] Sorry I didn\u0027t mention this when we were discussing it offline but as we were talking, I was visualizing the spoken words \"AVF non-secure\" as `/avf/non-secure`, not `/avfnonsecure`!",
      "range": {
