      "writtenOn": "2024-02-09T17:12:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But ABL could also set /avf/reference/avf-nonsecure? Or do we block that somewhere?\n\nAnyway, if @ptosi@google.com is happy, I\u0027m fine with it.",
      "parentUuid": "89680a85_eef54960",
